    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "tip",
      "title": "Quick test",
      "text": "Ask yourself: is it <b>what it is</b> (ser) or <b>how it is right now</b> (estar)? Ser = definition. Estar = condition and place. Events are the exception: <i>La boda es en la iglesia</i>."
    },
